    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Client Care Letter Automation (UK law firms)\n\nRuns AFTER the Intake workflow and the initial consultation.\n\n1. Solicitor opens the matter in a short form (client email, fees, who handles it)\n2. Client details are pulled from the Intake Log (no retyping)\n3. Validates data → alerts if something is missing\n4. AI writes ONLY the scope summary and next steps\n5. Fees, complaints and SRA text are fixed templates (AI never writes prices)\n6. Solicitor approves with one click (Human-in-the-loop)\n7. Letter is emailed to the client and logged in Google Sheets",
        "height": 364,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "abae1da9-1868-4ff6-a2f6-df4921807230",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
